# Mall Customer Segmentation

## Problem
Group mall customers into segments for targeted marketing.

## Dataset
Kaggle — Mall Customers Dataset (200 rows, 5 features)

## Algorithms Used
- StandardScaler
- K-Means Clustering
- t-SNE Visualization

## Key Findings
- Cluster 0 → Older Low Spenders
- Cluster 1 → High Earners Low Spenders  
- Cluster 2 → Young High Spenders
- Cluster 3 → Young Moderate Spenders

## Tools
Python, Pandas, Scikit-learn, Matplotlib
